# An example mesh for `benchmark_warmth_mesh` in `warmth.rs`, which documents the format.

relay origin near middle far pop edge-a edge-b

# Cores on a line, with long links from the origin that pass over the cores between,
# labelled so the report totals them.
link origin near 6 1 peer
link near middle 4 1 peer
link middle far 4 1 peer
link origin middle 6 6 peer backbone
link origin far 8 8 peer backbone

# A pop beside the far core, with its own long link.
link far pop 2 1 peer
link origin pop 9 4 peer backbone

# Edges mark their cores upstream.
link edge-a far 1 1 up
link edge-a middle 2 1 up
link edge-b pop 1 1 up

publish live origin
publish back edge-b

read live far near middle pop edge-a edge-b
read back origin edge-a near
